# TYPE vllm_omni:vae_decode_s histogram
# HELP vllm_omni:diffusion_forward_s Diffusion forward-only latency in seconds (denoise loop; excludes preprocess / postprocess / VAE decode / KV load). Absent when the pipeline profiler is off.
# TYPE vllm_omni:diffusion_forward_s histogram
# HELP vllm_omni:diffusion_kv_load_s Diffusion KV-recv latency in seconds (AR→diffusion KV fetch; absent when the stage has no upstream KV to receive).
# TYPE vllm_omni:diffusion_kv_load_s histogram
# HELP vllm_omni:image_ttfp_s Image time-to-first-output in seconds (stage submit → first image materialized; non-streaming single-image). Stage-level, not e2e — excludes API queue and inter-stage transfer before the image stage.
